  "description": ".NET for Android / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog Android SDK's dd-sdk-android-trace module: distributed tracing (APM) through Trace, TraceConfiguration, DatadogTracing and GlobalDatadogTracer. Built against dd-sdk-android 3.12.1. Note that dd-sdk-android 3.0 removed AndroidTracer and the OpenTracing dependency; DatadogTracing.NewTracerBuilder is the replacement. Add DatadogNet.OkHttp.Android to trace outgoing HTTP calls.",
